@startuml 07-tilstand-scan
title Tilstandsdiagram – Scan-skærmen (app/scan.tsx)
hide empty description

[*] --> TjekkerTilladelse
state "Tjekker tilladelse\n(permission = null)" as TjekkerTilladelse
state "Mangler tilladelse" as Mangler
state "Scanner\n(barcode = null)" as Scanner
state "Slår op\n(result = null)" as SlaarOp
state "Fejl / ikke fundet" as Fejl
state "Portionsformular" as Form

TjekkerTilladelse --> Scanner : [granted]
TjekkerTilladelse --> Mangler : [ikke granted]
Mangler --> Scanner : requestPermission() [granted]
Mangler --> [*] : Open settings / luk

Scanner --> Form : onBarcodeScanned [findes i savedFoods]
Scanner --> SlaarOp : onBarcodeScanned [ikke gemt]
SlaarOp --> Form : [status = found]
SlaarOp --> Fejl : [status = missing ∨ error]
SlaarOp --> [*] : luk skærm / abort()

Fejl --> Scanner : "Scan again" / rescan()
Form --> Scanner : "Scan another barcode" / rescan()
Form --> [*] : "Add" [gram gyldig]\n/ addFood(), evt. saveFood()
@enduml
